<title>USA: New York cert. cotton stocks rise to 101,992.</title>
<headline>New York cert. cotton stocks rise to 101,992.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Certificated cotton stocks deliverable against New York Cotton Exchange's No. 2 cotton futures contract as of January 28 totaled 101,992 bales, up from 99,899 bales the previous session.</p>
<p>There were 2,093 bales issued, 3,019 decertification orders,no cancellations, and 9,079 bales awaiting review.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodity Desk 212 859 1640</p>
</text>
